OL,3,ABBC appoints Rachel Jupp as new
OL,4,Adirector of news
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Jupp said she was
OL,7,F"honoured to be asked to lead BBC
OL,8,FNews", while the corporation's
OL,9,Fdirector-general Matt Brittin described
OL,10,Fher as "an outstanding editorial
OL,11,Fleader".
